WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 002. ONE IDEA. MANY AUDIENCES.. Adaptation is useful only if the factual core survives.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
SOURCE TRUTH. LOCK WHAT MUST NOT MOVE.. Numbers · names · uncertainty · negation · material facts.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
TRANSFORM. CHANGE THE EXPLANATION.. Register, context, examples and vocabulary may move for the audience.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
VERIFY. CHECK DRIFT SEPARATELY.. Fluency is not evidence that a rewrite preserved meaning.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
BOUNDARY. AN ANCHOR CHECK IS AN ALARM—NOT PROOF.. Consequential multilingual or domain communication still requires competent review.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. TRUTH FIRST. AUDIENCE SECOND. VERIFY THIRD.. Never let the rewrite become its own source of truth.

